# Raw NCBI downloads and the filtered genome set (added 2026-11-21).
#
# These are the bulk unaligned genomes, ~300 MB, and two individual files exceed GitHub's
# 100 MB hard limit, so a plain `git add -A` would produce a push that is rejected outright.
# They are also the one part of the pipeline that is exactly reproducible from a public
# source: 19_supplements/S2_final_accessions.tsv pins every accession analysed, and
# 09_scripts/step01*-step02* re-fetch them with the NCBI datasets CLI.
#
# Everything derived from them -- CDS, alignments, trees, selection results, predictions --
# IS tracked, so the analysis can be checked without re-downloading.
hsv_curated_dataset/00_raw_downloads/
hsv_curated_dataset/02_filtered_genomes/

# Withdrawn v1 HyPhy raw output (added 2026-11-21).
#
# 1.3 GB of JSON from the superseded v1 selection pipeline: pooled-type runs whose
# results were withdrawn (see CORRECTIONS_AND_PENDING_WORK.md). No live script reads
# it, and the live selection results are in 14_selection/. Committing it would put
# 1.3 GB of withdrawn output into the repository permanently.
#
# The files are still on disk, and the 14 small summary tables and logs directly in
# 07_qc_reports/hyphy/ -- which the corrections register cites -- ARE tracked.
hsv_curated_dataset/07_qc_reports/hyphy/stage1/
hsv_curated_dataset/07_qc_reports/hyphy/stage2/
hsv_curated_dataset/07_qc_reports/hyphy/gard/
